References:

     Kwiatkowski D, Phillips PCB, Schmidt P, Shin Y (1992). "Testing
     the Null Hypothesis of Stationarity Against the Alternative of a
     Unit Root." _Journal of Econometrics_, *54*(1-3), 159-178.
     doi:10.1016/0304-4076(92)90104-y
     <https://doi.org/10.1016/0304-4076%2892%2990104-y>.

