     'pp.test'

Examples:

     x <- rnorm(1000)  # is level stationary 
References:

     Banerjee A, Dolado JJ, Galbraith JW, Hendry D (1993).
     _Co-integration, Error Correction, and the Econometric Analysis of
     Non-Stationary Data_. Oxford University Press. ISBN 9780198288107.
     doi:10.1093/0198288107.001.0001
     <https://doi.org/10.1093/0198288107.001.0001>.

